// Windows Security events arriving via the direct-AMA DCR path.
// Lands in SecurityEvent (rich rule coverage), NOT WindowsEvent (the WEF path).
// Note: Computer holds the 15-char NetBIOS name (truncated from a longer Azure VM name) -
// filter with startswith, not an exact match on the full Azure resource name.
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(1h)
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Account, AccountType, EventID, Activity
| order by TimeGenerated desc
